<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">
  <div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Visão Geral</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground">Gerencie usuários, decks e flashcards da plataforma</p>
  </div>
  <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground">
    <div class="flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight">Bem-vindo ao Painel Administrativo</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Use o menu lateral para navegar entre as diferentes seções</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-6 pt-0">
      <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Este é o dashboard administrativo onde você pode gerenciar todos os aspectos da plataforma. As estatísticas serão implementadas gradualmente.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center justify-between pb-2">
        <h3 class="tracking-tight text-sm font-medium">Total de usuários</h3>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground">
          <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
          <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
          <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 pt-0">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold"><%= User.count %></div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Usuários registrados</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center justify-between pb-2">
        <h3 class="tracking-tight text-sm font-medium">Total de decks</h3>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground">
          <path d="M12 7v14"></path>
          <path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 pt-0">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold"><%= Deck.count %></div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Decks criados</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground">
      <div class="space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center justify-between pb-2">
        <h3 class="tracking-tight text-sm font-medium">Total de flashcards</h3>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground">
          <path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path>
          <path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path>
          <path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path>
          <path d="M16 17H8"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 pt-0">
        <div class="text-2xl font-bold"><%= Flashcard.count %></div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Flashcards cadastrados</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
